        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/doom-the-dark-ages-flying-monster.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Xbox-published shooter <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/doom-the-dark-ages\">Doom: The Dark Ages</a> has been cracked by anti-DRM pirates, it's been revealed, with a Reddit user who goes by voices38 <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/CrackWatch/comments/1rsydlr/doomthedarkagesvoices38/\">announcing</a> the bypassing of its unpopular Denuvo software on 13th March (<a href=\"https://www.thegamer.com/doom-the-dark-ages-cracked-on-pc/\">via TheGamer</a>).</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/doom-the-dark-ages-denuvo-has-been-cracked\">Read more</a></p>",
